<title>USA: Columbus, Ohio, school notes won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Columbus, Ohio, school notes won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said Thursday it won $18 million Columbus City School District, Ohio, tax and revenue anticipation notes at a net interest cost of 3.516 percent.</p>
<p>The notes carry a coupon of 4.00 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
